\f1\par
\f0 Henry Dachowitz, Chief Financial Officer, provided an update regarding the calculation of time and attendance for the Police and Fire Departments stating that stated that they were currently in the quality control phase, and were looking at the next few months until implementation.\par
\f1\par
\f0 Jay Stacy, Chief Technical Officer, explained that the delays were caused by issues migrating from the Telestaff system to the UKG cloud, which was compromised by a hack.\par
\f1\par
\pard\f0 The Commission expressed their gratitude to Mr. Stacy for his exceptional work.\cf1\f1\par
}

