\f1\par
\f0 Mr. Hadjimiry stated that at approximately 4:00 a.m., the past Saturday, while drilling for the new Water Treatment Plant, a deep well raw water main was impacted. He stated that the flooding was contained by 11:00 p.m. that evening. Residents were not affected because water was provided through an interconnect system with the City of Boca Raton and the Palm Beach County Water Utilities Department.\par
