Anthea Gianniotes, Development Services Director, honored longtime City employee Jennifer Buce, a Delray Beach native and daughter of a retired firefighter, highlighting her 30 years of service, extensive institutional knowledge, and major contributions-including digitizing 3,750 paper files to build the City\rquote s online records library-and praised her lasting impact on community events, development processes, and staff support while recognizing her career as a \ldblquote legendary run\rdblquote with the City. She presented Ms. Buce with a plaque and a framed copy of the resolution in recognition of her 30 years of service to the City. \par
}

