\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\fs24 Janai Bowens, Assistant Director of Neighborhood and Community Services, recognized Tavarous Parks, Neighborhood Services Administrator, as the recipient of the City Manager\rquote s Recognition Award. She noted that, under his leadership, the Neighborhood Services team completed 32 housing rehabilitation projects in the past year, with 81% of program applicants coming from extremely low- and very low-income households. She commended his compassion, professionalism, and commitment to providing safe, sustainable, and affordable housing opportunities for Delray Beach residents.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\fs24 Commissioner Mollica read the proclamation into the record.\par
